WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.573
Connection Design  ·  Worked example

00:00:00.573 --> 00:00:04.054
Choose the double-angle beam-to-post connection and inspect the members in 3D.

00:00:04.054 --> 00:00:10.029
Enter the simultaneous training ULS actions and identify the case source.

00:00:10.029 --> 00:00:12.902
Size the bolts and cleats for the entered actions. Inspect the proposed layout.

00:00:12.902 --> 00:00:19.473
Verify the current connection and review the geometry and component results.

00:00:19.473 --> 00:00:22.728
Check all outstanding items before project approval. A passing fit check covers geometry only.
